Functional Requirements:
Customer registration and authentication
Restaurant Onboarding - images, csvs, documents might need to be uploaded which need to be verified by swiggy
Delivery person onboarding
Restaurant manages menu
Nearby restaurants - proximity service
Browse restaurants and menus
Add items to the cart - Can we add items from multiple restaurants at the same time?
Place orders
Inventory Management
Payment gateway integration
Restaurant receives order
Nearby delivery person - similar to cab booking service with some modifications
Real-time order tracking
Order history and reordering
Rating and reviews for restaurants/dishes
Push notifications for order status updates

Non-functional requirement:
Scalability, Consistency, High Availability, Low Latency,

Capacity Estimation:
Restaurants - 1 million, 100 new added every day, in 20 years newly added will be 0.73 million,
Customers - 100 million, 10k/day, in 20 years 73 million,
Search / Views - 100 million/day,

APIs:
GET getNearbyRestaurants(location, radius) : List<Restaurant> sorted by distance
GET getMenus(restaurantId) : List<ItemDetails>
POST addCart(restaurantId, itemId, quantity) : boolean
POST placeOrder() : boolean
GET getOrderStatus(orderId) : Status
GET getPricing(orderId) : totalPrice
GET getPricing(orderId, restaurantId) : totalPrice
GET getPricing(orderId, restaurantId, itemId) : Price - It may be a discounted price so sending orderId and restaurantId as well.

Order - orderId, List<RestaurantOrder>,
RestaurantOrder - restaurantId, List<Item>,
Item - itemId, quantity,

